      "description": "Noiseless simulation of the proposed FQAOA-SCLFM on electric power demand portfolio optimization for 20 residences, evaluated across eight time periods (T = 0, 3, 6, 9, 12, 15, 18, 21) and QAOA depths p = 0, 1, 10.",
      "algorithm": {
